{
  "name": "Nexo Solar - Correos al cliente",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "nexo-solar-correos",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "734cc11c-1f43-48bf-b344-2e46130a59af",
      "name": "Webhook (Nexo Solar)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "67560b8b-f76c-4f9b-8f92-ad3fc9de6334"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.body.subject }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "={{ $json.body.html }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "senderName": "Nexo Solar"
        }
      },
      "id": "bad7b26f-d47a-43f0-aa6c-8755d64ecbe3",
      "name": "Enviar por Gmail",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "a5fc6083-82bd-4150-b3fb-e4b1cac3748a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"ok\": true, \"event\": $('Webhook (Nexo Solar)').item.json.body.event, \"id\": $('Webhook (Nexo Solar)').item.json.body.id } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "dd120a2d-6ae9-4a01-acc2-550a8578bbdd",
      "name": "Responder OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Correos al cliente de Nexo Solar\nEl backend manda aquí 3 tipos de correo, ya armados (destinatario, asunto y HTML):\n- **solicitud.recibida**: el cliente pidió su cotización\n- **propuesta.enviada**: el equipo publicó la propuesta\n- **compra.completada**: comprobante de compra\n\n**Configura 2 cosas:**\n1. Webhook → Credential: *Header Auth* con Name `x-nexo-secret` y Value = tu `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.\n2. Enviar por Gmail → conecta tu cuenta de Gmail.\n\nLuego actívalo/publícalo y copia la **Production URL** en `N8N_WEBHOOK_URL`.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "61ed61c0-8112-4adf-9fbd-46bcc11bafa0",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -400
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook (Nexo Solar)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Enviar por Gmail",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Enviar por Gmail": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Responder OK",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
